        "TileImage": "$($repository 6bb2d3f9-f1ad-4239-8bc8-5d100f3ec644).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. \rYour target is William Candler, a &apos;Providence&apos; herald and field-handler of Gustavo Torres, the Mexican Secretary of the Interior. Gustavo also is a high-ranking &apos;Providence&apos; member, so we need to cut the ties to the federal goverments, to avoid a disaster. Candler is currently held hostage by the &apos;Private Militia&apos; and his elimination, which will be noticed, needs to be blamed on them. \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages. \rGood luck 47. \rMission status: ACTIVE",
